@@ -0,0 +1,370 @@
+/* Provide relocatable programs.
+   Copyright (C) 2003-2008 Free Software Foundation, Inc.
+   Written by Bruno Haible <bruno@clisp.org>, 2003.
+
+   This program is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify
